+<article id="post-4483" class="post-4483 page type-page status-publish hentry">
+	<header class="entry-header resort-content">
+		<h1 class="entry-title">Rental Management Services</h1>	</header><!-- .entry-header -->
+
+	
+	<div class="entry-content">
+		
+<p class="wp-block-paragraph">When you become a member of the Sands Resorts Rental Management Program you will reap the benefits of having an experienced resort team on site promoting your property and catering to your guests. As your professional owner services rental management company, we manage the day-to-day needs of your vacation rental property! With our exceptional staff, there is no delay in providing the timely and exceptional customer service our resort’s guests require. One of the true advantages of being part of the Sands Resorts Rental Program is for your vacationing rental guests. Only our rental program’s vacation guests will have access to all of the awesome amenities Sands Resorts has to offer. Please visit the Sand Dunes Resort website amenities page for details.</p>
+
+
+
+<p class="has-text-align-center has-text-color has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph" style="color:#41a7aa"><strong>If you are interested in taking part in our rental program, please contact the Rental Management Service Representative at 843-692-5174 for further information.</strong></p>
+
+
+
+<div style="height:40px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>
+
+
+
+<div class="wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-top is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
+<div class="wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
+<h3 class="wp-block-heading">The Management Benefits of the Sands Resorts Rental Program</h3>
+
+
+
+<ul class="wp-block-list">
+<li>Professional Guest Relations</li>
+
+
+
+<li>Knowledgeable Rental Representatives</li>
+
+
