+<h3 class="wp-block-heading">The Vacation Guests’ Advantages of the Sand Dunes Resort</h3>
+
+
+
+<ul class="wp-block-list">
+<li>Resort Guest Relations Staff available 24/7</li>
+
+
+
+<li>Access to All Resort Amenities
+<ul class="wp-block-list">
+<li>On-site Waterpark</li>
+
+
+
+<li>Outdoor and Indoor Pools</li>
+
+
+
+<li>Family FunZone Games &amp; Adventure</li>
+
+
+
+<li>Neptune Blacklight Mini Golf Course</li>
+</ul>
+</li>
+
+
+
+<li>Onsite Housekeepers and Maintenance</li>
+
+
+
+<li>Full -time Resort Security Staff</li>
+</ul>
+</div>
+</div>
+
+
+
+<div style="height:40px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>
+
+
+
+<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Financial Management</h2>
+
+
+
+<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Our accounting department understands that the financial health of your condo is a primary concern and we will help you track your rental income and all relevant costs with detailed monthly financial statements. Statements are provided every month and listing all income payments for reservations accrued for your condo unit. In addition, work orders that occur for your condo are documented so you can stay up to date with any repairs or routine maintenance in your condo rental unit. The accounting department will also provide your monthly rental payments via checks or direct deposit along with your monthly statement. With an investment in a rental property, accurate annual tax documents are vital. Our experienced accounting team understands the importance and will ensure that all your 1099 tax forms are completed with accuracy and in a timely fashion.</p>
+
+
+
+<div style="height:40px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>
+
+
+
+<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Housekeeping &amp; Maintenance</h2>
+
+
+
+<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We selectively hire, train and retain our onsite housekeeping and maintenance staff with the goal to provide our homeowners and guests with the highest level of cleanliness in order to offer the best maintained rentable condo units. Our goal is for each of our homeowners to be worry free about every detail of maintenance and cleanliness. We take pride in your condo unit, just as you do, and we will do everything possible to make sure all your concerns are addressed promptly. We provide all linens, departure maid service and departure inspection. Our computerized resort management system tracks all details of any service performed in your condo. See our lease agreement for details related to the management of these projects.</p>
+
+
+
+<div style="height:40px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>
+
+
+
+<figure class="wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex">
+<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img decoding="async" width="600" height="400" data-id="4489" src="https://www.sandsresorts.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/SDOFM1.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-4489" srcset="https://www.sandsresorts.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/SDOFM1.jpg 600w, https://www.sandsresorts.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/SDOFM1-300x200.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 85vw, 600px" /></figure>
+
+
+
+<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="400" data-id="4488" src="https://www.sandsresorts.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Sands-Resorts-41.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-4488" srcset="https://www.sandsresorts.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Sands-Resorts-41.jpg 600w, https://www.sandsresorts.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Sands-Resorts-41-300x200.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 600px) 85vw, 600px" /></figure>
+</figure>
+
+
+
+<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Strategic Marketing</h2>
+
+
+
+<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We have taken great measures to be a step ahead and beyond our competitors by making sure that we are visible across the internet. We maximize the potential of your condo by evaluating guest vacation preferences, market trends, individual property performance and other important factors while investing over $350,000 into our strategic marketing plans. We constantly monitor the local rental market to establish optimum rental rates throughout the Myrtle Beach vacation seasons.</p>
+
+
+
+<div style="height:40px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>
+
+
+
+<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
+<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:50%">
+<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Our Marketing Strategies Include</strong></p>
+</div>
+
+
+
+<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:50%">
+<ul class="wp-block-list">
+<li>Extensive and Responsive Resort Websites</li>
+
+
+
+<li>Resort Listings on all Major Online Travel Agent Sites</li>
+
+
+
+<li>SEO &amp; SEM Services</li>
+
+
+
+<li>Social Media Platforms</li>
+
+
+
+<li>Targeted Email Marketing</li>
+
+
+
+<li>Pay Per Click Advertising</li>
+
+
+
+<li>Involvement in Local Events</li>
+
+
+
+<li>Partnership with Area Golf Travel Companies</li>
+</ul>
+</div>
