+
+
+
+<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Guest Relations &amp; Reservations</h2>
+
+
+
+<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We provide a centralized reservation department with a state-of -the- art computerized resort reservation system along with a robust online booking engine via the resort website. We also receive reservations through the industry’s leading online travel sites including Expedia, Booking.com, Hotels.com etc. Our experienced reservation staff is knowledgeable of the resort and the needs of our vacation guests. Our resort front desk is staffed every hour of each day servicing our resort arrival and departure guests with the convenience of a systematic check-in process. We pride ourselves in our customer service to make sure every guest receives the special attention they deserve for a fantastic vacation experience.</p>
+
+
+
+<div style="height:40px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>
+
+
+
+<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Owner Portal Website</h2>
+
+
+
+<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The Sands Resorts dedicated Rental Management Services Owners Portal Website is readily available to respond to our owners’ requests and concerns. Here you can contact our dedicated rental management services department, view the latest design ideas and stay up to date with our owners’ community events. One of our objectives is to assist our owners by coordinating engineering, housekeeping and reservations requests made by owners along with any other special needs and/or requests made by owners on our on-site rental program.&nbsp;&nbsp;Upgrades and replacements are critical to the on-going success of your rentals. We will also help keep you one step ahead with the latest interior designs and upgrade options. Our owners’ portal site provides these conveniences along with helping you to understand the many services, programs and condo unit materials available to help maintain and improve your condo rental.</p>
+
+
+
+<div style="height:40px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>
+
+
+
+<div class="wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-fe48e5de wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex">
+<div class="wp-block-button gb-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link has-text-color has-background has-custom-font-size wp-element-button" href="https://sanddunesrms.com/" style="border-radius:5px;color:#ffffff;background-color:#41a7aa;padding-top:10px;padding-right:1em;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:1em;font-size:20px;line-height:1.2" target="_blank">Access to the Owners Portal Website</a></div>
+</div>
+
+
+
+<div style="height:40px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>
+
+
+
+<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Rental Representative</h2>
+
+
+
+<p class="wp-block-paragraph">A dedicated Rental Management Representative is appointed to all owners of the rental program. This individual can answer any questions, coordinate unit upgrades or help the owner with any issues that may arise. Building a lasting relationship with the owners is important to us and we consider these partnerships to be the base of our business. Your concerns will be met with respect and your questions will be answered promptly, professionally and honestly. With our competitive commission program, you will receive your monies worth choosing the convenient and exceptional service that the Sands Resorts Rental Management Program has to offer. You can relax knowing we take pride in bringing confidence and security to your condo rental unit.</p>
+
+
+
+<p class="has-text-align-center has-text-color has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph" style="color:#41a7aa">If you are interested in taking part in our rental program, please contact the Rental Management Service Representative at 843-692-5174 for further information or complete our&nbsp;<a href="#rental-form">contact form.</a></p>
+
