 or one of my investment properties? We do not offer HELOCs for investment properties; however, you can get a HELOC for a second home if the property meets our eligibility standards. Eligible property types include primary residences and second homes (located at least 50 miles from the primary residence) owned for at least 6 months. Properties must be one of the following: single-family homes, 2-4-unit condominiums, owner-occupied duplexes, or townhouses. Member Resources Make a payment Report lost card Forms About Connexus About us Become a member Careers More Privacy Disclosures & fees Sitemap Member Resources Make a payment Report lost card Forms About Connexus About us Become a member Careers More Privacy Disclosures & fees Sitemap Iconly/Bold/Call 800.845.5025 Iconly/Bold/Location Location & ATMs Iconly/Bold/Message Contact Us Routing #: 275982296 © 2026 Connexus Credit Union. All Rights Reserved | NMLS ID: 649316 
